    "product_testimonials_ADpfgF": {
      "type": "product-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonials_items_D4xR7G": {
          "type": "testimonials_items",
          "settings": {
            "author_rating": 5,
            "author_text": "<p>I’m truly mesmerized by the Pattachitra saree ,’Festive Threads’ I bought from your collection. The visual storytelling on the pallu is nothing short of captivating — every motif feels like a scene from folklore brought to life through vibrant colors and fine craftsmanship. It’s not just attire, I’ll call it wearable art. The silk is lush and comfortable, and the saree drapes effortlessly, giving it a graceful fall. I wore it to a cultural event, and it turned heads all evening — so many people asked where it was from! Thank you for the wonderful addition to my wardrobe.</p>",
            "select_product": "deep-sea-drape",
            "author_name": "Shivani Sharma,Perth, Australia"
          }
        },
        "testimonials_items_7na7pp": {
          "type": "testimonials_items",
          "settings": {
            "author_rating": 5,
            "author_text": "<p>I’m thrilled with my Cavirk saree—the quality of the fabric and exquisite Kantha stitching are simply unmatched. The vibrant colors make it truly special!</p>",
            "select_product": "golden-vows",
            "author_name": "Ritu Arora, Gurgaon"
          }
        },
        "testimonials_items_M8Nm79": {
          "type": "testimonials_items",
          "settings": {
            "author_rating": 5,
            "author_text": "<p>The saree and the shawl are very pretty. Loved both of them.</p>",
            "select_product": "emerald-divine",
            "author_name": "Ananya Mishra, Bangalore"
          }
        },
        "testimonials_items_cBDEfL": {
          "type": "testimonials_items",
          "settings": {
            "author_rating": 5,
            "author_text": "<p>I recently purchased a Madhubani saree from Cavirk, and I couldn’t be happier with my choice! The saree is absolutely beautiful and exquisitely crafted, with intricate artwork that truly stands out. The detailing is stunning, reflecting the rich heritage of Madhubani artistry. The fabric feels premium, and the colors are vibrant yet elegant. It’s a perfect blend of tradition and exclusivity. I highly recommend Cavirk’s collection.</p>",
            "select_product": "majestic-melody",
            "author_name": "Himani Tyagi, Bangalore"
          }
        }
      },
